/ImageType 1 def
/Width cols def
/Height rows def
/ImageMatrix [cols 0 0 rows neg 0 rows] def
/BitsPerComponent 8 def
/Decode [0 1] def
/DataSource currentfile /ASCII85Decode filter
/DCTDecode filter def
currentdict end
